  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"563\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"561\">Notes:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"761\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"609\">\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"609\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"579\">Negative:</strong> No evidence of brucellosis.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"664\">\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"664\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"629\">Positive IgM:</strong> Suggests recent/acute infection.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"723\">\n<p data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"723\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"684\">Positive IgG:</strong> Indicates past or chronic infection.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"761\">\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"761\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Confirm with ELISA/SAT if needed.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
